  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文獻研討",
    "sub_ename": "LITERATURE DISCUSSION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要提供學生認識研究論文的組成成分並進行口頭報告的實務訓練。討論會每次由幾位指定的學生進行口頭報告，由聽眾提問，並進行答辯以及綜合討論。學期中並穿插幾場外來學者演講，供學生觀摩學習。本課程可使學生經由事前對研讀題材的整理，培養學生利用適當之媒體進行有效率的簡報能力；藉由報告過程的答辯與討論活動，提供學生改進口頭報告技能之機會；透過觀摩演講與研讀論文的過程，增進學生相關知識之深度與廣度。",
    "describe_eh": "This course primarily provides opportunities for students to understand the composition of a technical research paper and to practice skills of oral presentation. During the course some students were assigned to give talks about their studies, the audience may ask questions and have discussions. A few invited talks are also given by some scholars in the semester. This course provides trainings for the students on preparation of the speaking material, utilizing appropriate multimedia to give an effective presentation in the speaking. With the process of questioning and rebottling, it is possible for the students to improve their skills in briefing. The depth and spanning of the students' knowledge can also be expanded from the published reports and the examples of the invited talks.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解專題簡報與科技論文的必要內容。",
      "describe_en": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解並說明如何建構碩士論文與期刊論文。",
      "describe_en": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "describe_ch": "學生能辨識出論文之動機、問題與解決問題之方法並清楚地表達。",
      "describe_en": null
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "describe_ch": "能使用所研讀之心得，有助於論文之分析、設計、模擬與驗證",
      "describe_en": null
    }
  ],
